  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... S’il vous plaît... Puis-je... Puis-je vous\ndéranger un instant ? J’ai besoin d’aide...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà... J’ai un rendez-vous galant avec une fille\nqui adore les Chacripan...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaaa...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100610061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais j’ai trop peur de lui parler !\nC’est pour ça que j’ai besoin de vous...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourriez-vous m’aider à faire la conversation ?\nS’il vous plaît ! Je suis désespéré !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prévenez-moi si jamais vous acceptez.\nJ’en appelle à votre bon cœur...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaaa...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100610061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, acceptez-vous de m’aider ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C00200061006300630065007000740065007A002D0076006F007500730020006400650020006D2019006100690064006500720020003F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous pouvez compter sur moi !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200070006F007500760065007A00200063006F006D007000740065007200200073007500720020006D006F0069002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200065006E0063006F00720065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, ne me donnez pas de faux espoirs, comme ça.\nJe sens que mon cœur va exploser !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci, je... Je compte sur vous !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007200630069002C0020006A0065002E002E002E0020004A006500200063006F006D007000740065002000730075007200200076006F007500730020002100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La fille avec qui j’ai rendez-vous ADORE\nles Chacripan...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’en ai donc attrapé un, mais je ne sais\nabsolument rien sur ce Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 140
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaaa...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100610061002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Donc j’aimerais que vous vous asseyiez à côté\nde moi pour m’aider en cas de pépin...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Elle va bientôt arriver...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSi elle me pose des questions sur Chacripan,\nje compte sur vous pour m’aider à y répondre !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il n’y a rien de mieux que de se poser à la terrasse\nd’un café pour discuter de mon Pokémon favori !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous savez de quel Pokémon il s’agit,\nn’est-ce pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200073006100760065007A0020006400650020007100750065006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200069006C0020007320190061006700690074002C000A006E2019006500730074002D0063006500200070006100730020003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Pokémon Scélérat !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200053006300E9006C00E9007200610074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Pokémon Implacable !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200049006D0070006C0061006300610062006C0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Pokémon Intimidation !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200049006E00740069006D00690064006100740069006F006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Scélérat ! C’est exact ! Vous connaissez bien\nla réputation des Chacripan, vous !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... C’est comme ça que vous décririez\nles Chacripan, vous ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E00200043201900650073007400200063006F006D006D0065002000E70061002000710075006500200076006F007500730020006400E9006300720069007200690065007A000A006C00650073002000430068006100630072006900700061006E002C00200076006F007500730020003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et vous savez pourquoi ces Pokémon aiment\nnous voler des objets ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200076006F0075007300200073006100760065007A00200070006F0075007200710075006F0069002000630065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000610069006D0065006E0074000A006E006F0075007300200076006F006C0065007200200064006500730020006F0062006A0065007400730020003F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est un besoin vital !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006E0020006200650073006F0069006E00200076006900740061006C002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est juste pour s’amuser !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004320190065007300740020006A007500730074006500200070006F007500720020007320190061006D0075007300650072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est parce qu’ils nous détestent.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200070006100720063006500200071007520190069006C00730020006E006F007500730020006400E900740065007300740065006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Absolument ! Quand on vit avec un Chacripan,\non s’amuse tous les jours !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous sortez ça d’où ? Il me semble qu’ils sont\nun peu plus... joueurs, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si vous êtes incollable sur les Chacripan, vous\nconnaîtrez sûrement la réponse à cette question...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuelle capacité croit-on À TORT qu’ils peuvent\napprendre ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tourmente !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F00750072006D0065006E00740065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Machination !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006300680069006E006100740069006F006E002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tricherie !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400720069006300680065007200690065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, c’est ça ! C’est curieux qu’ils n’apprennent\npas cette capacité, n’est-ce pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vraiment... ? Il me semble pourtant qu’il peut\nutiliser cette capacité...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaaa.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100610061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tout cas, c’est toujours un plaisir de discuter\navec quelqu’un qui aime les Chacripan !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je... Euh...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai l’impression que mon Chacripan s’entend\nbien avec vous et...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaaa.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100610061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et je me suis bien amusé aussi...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nÇa vous dirait si... euh... si nous sortions\nà nouveau ensemble ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmmm... Pour être honnête avec vous, j’ai des\ndoutes sur vos connaissances sur les Chacripan.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe regrette, mais je préfère que nous en restions\nlà. Adieu, monsieur.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 172
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le monde s’écroule autour d’Eugêne !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C00650020006D006F006E0064006500200073201900E900630072006F0075006C00650020006100750074006F0075007200200064201900450075006700EA006E0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avec grand plaisir !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai hâte que nous partagions à nouveau\nnotre amour pour les Chacripan !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaaa. ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100610061002E0020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est vrai ?! Oh... Merci !\nEuh... Excusez-moi un instant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006500730074002000760072006100690020003F00210020004F0068002E002E002E0020004D006500720063006900200021000A004500750068002E002E002E0020004500780063007500730065007A002D006D006F006900200075006E00200069006E007300740061006E00740020002100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heureusement que vous étiez là, je n’ai\nstrictement rien compris à ses questions...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais au moins, grâce à vous, elle a accepté de\nme revoir ! Merci du fond du cœur !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 6204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, je dois y retourner pour la raccompagner.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOh là là, j’espère qu’elle ne va pas recommencer\nà parler des Chacripan...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 6380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 6640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai encore le trac, mais quand je suis à court\nde sujets de conversation, je parle un peu de moi,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nou je lui demande ce qu’elle aime...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 6652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Chaaa.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 6940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00430068006100610061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand il est nerveux, c’est son Chacripan\nqui s’exprime à sa place.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIl a vraiment trouvé le partenaire idéal,\nvous ne trouvez pas ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 6956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    }
